---
description: HVAC visual calls that must not be "fixed" away; duplicate CSS + live copies
alwaysApply: true
---

These are locked user calls. Do not treat reserved space, missing fill, or a one-line status as a bug. Edit **site-server** and copy the same files into `site-keeping-busy-hvac-live/Runtime/copied/`. Page `#id` CSS beats `body` element CSS — change both.

- ZIP `.zip-check`: `min-height: 10.25rem`. `.zip-check-msg`: two-line `min-height: calc(1.45em * 2)`; `[hidden]{display:block;visibility:hidden}`. Never `min-height: 0` or `display: none`.
- Photo hosts (`.photo-fill`, clip, `.area-photo`, `.card-media`, `.card-media-frame`, `.tip-media`, any `img` with slide/bounce load): `background: none !important`. No `--border`/cream plate during slide-in. Do not use `isolation: isolate` on `.photo-fill-clip` (it composites an opaque box). Overflow hidden is enough to clip motion. Maps may keep `--border`.
- Integrity photo: `image-slide-right` / `slide-in-right` only. Healer fallback is right, not bottom. `__psArm` drops peer entrance classes.
- Services area CTAs: `.area-ctas` `z-index: 3` (above the photo in `#ps-m-phone`).
- Area photo: `aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; min-height: 420px; max-height: none`. Catalog/integrity photos: `8 / 5`, no `max-height: 220px` on area/banner.
- Contact cards: `animName: slide-in-right`. Contact side photo load off.
- Footer: reveal on `html.ps-ent-ready` as well as fonts-ready. Social row `padding-block: 1rem` between catalog dividers.
- Header phone pill: `min-height: var(--btn-h-sm, 36px)`.
